sequenceDiagram
  actor Customer
  participant Gateway
  participant Transfer as Transaction Service
  participant Fraud
  participant Account
  participant Ledger
  participant Outbox
  participant Kafka
  Customer->>Gateway: POST transfer + Idempotency-Key
  Gateway->>Transfer: JWT-validated request
  Transfer->>Transfer: Validate and persist PENDING transfer
  Transfer->>Fraud: Score risk
  alt score exceeds hold threshold
    Transfer->>Outbox: Persist fraud event in same transaction
  else score accepted
    Transfer->>Account: Apply locked debit and credit
    Transfer->>Ledger: Post balanced journal entry
    Transfer->>Outbox: Persist completion notification event
  end
  Outbox->>Kafka: Publish pending events
  Kafka-->>Customer: Notification consumer stores inbox item
